    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "hola"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "So I just have to tell you"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "Last Sunday, I brought in Jet’s pizza and I got yelled at by Ron"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "Because it’s a health risk"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "So today"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "Not bc it’s not LCE?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:30 PM",
      "text": "I ordered two large pizzas, a Jet bread and a two liter of pop"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:31 PM",
      "text": "And I had it delivered to Comerica Park for █████████████"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:31 PM",
      "text": "And someone keeps blowing me up to pick up the pizza"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:36 PM",
      "text": "LOL"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:37 PM",
      "text": "Did you pay with card or do COD?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:37 PM",
      "text": "I paid with card, I don’t give a fuck"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "3:37 PM",
      "text": "I was going to stop by the place and pay with cash but seriously, who cares"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:38 PM",
      "text": "Hahaha I could just see him getting the call and being like “Fenech!”"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET █████████████",
      "time": "3:38 PM",
      "text": "Hopefully just like this"
